            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 144811,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um elemento é o que chamamos de tag de abertura, tag de fechamento e código no meio.</p><p>Qual destes é um <strong>elemento</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;button&gt;Start Game&lt;/button&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;button&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;h1&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;/p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt;button&gt;Start Game&lt;/button&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 144812,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique um elemento <code>h1</code> que exiba <code>My First Game</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;button&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/video&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My First Game\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code> seguido de <code>My First Game</code> e finalmente <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 144813,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para criar uma página web, você precisará de uma tag HTML de abertura e fechamento. Qual dessas opções criará uma página HTML <strong>vazia</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;html&gt; &lt;/html&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;button&gt; &lt;/button&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;h1&gt; &lt;/h1&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt;html&gt; &lt;/html&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 144814,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie uma página da web codificando um elemento <code>html</code>.</p><p>Lembre-se de que podemos criar um elemento <code>html</code> codificando <code>&lt;html&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/html&gt;</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;button&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h1&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"14\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;html&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;/html&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 144815,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os elementos <code>html</code> e <code>body</code> formam a estrutura de uma página web. Colocamos os elementos que queremos exibir dentro do body.</p><p>Mais tarde, vamos aprender sobre outros elementos que vão dentro de <code>&lt;html&gt; &lt;/html&gt;</code> para dar estilo às páginas de jogos e torná-las interativas.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;body&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;/body&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 144816,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual desses códigos define o corpo de uma página da web?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;body&gt; &lt;/body&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;html&gt; &lt;/html&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;h1&gt; &lt;/h1&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt;body&gt; &lt;/body&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
